    "instructions": [
      {
        "text": "Dissolve the salt in the warm water: that spreads it evenly instead of leaving it on the bottom of the jar."
      },
      {
        "text": "Rub the dried oregano between your palms and steep it in the vinegar for five minutes: it softens and releases its scent."
      },
      {
        "text": "Chop the parsley and garlic fine with a knife. The garlic is chopped rather than crushed: crushed it gives a sharpness that never leaves."
      },
      {
        "text": "Mix everything together, pour in the oil and stir. Let it stand two hours at room temperature."
